{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"handleOpenURL:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSURL","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"url"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"url","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL to process."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YES if the URL was handled by Pushwoosh, NO otherwise."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handles special Pushwoosh URLs, primarily used for:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Test device registration"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Register device for push testing via QR code"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Deep link tracking","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Process tracked deep links from push notifications"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Should be called from your app’s URL handling methods. Returns YES if the URL","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was a Pushwoosh URL and was handled, NO if it should be processed by your app."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle URLs in SceneDelegate (iOS 13+):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class SceneDelegate: UIResponder, UIWindowSceneDelegate {","","    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, openURLContexts URLContexts: Set<UIOpenURLContext>) {","        guard let url = URLContexts.first?.url else { return }","","        \/\/ First, check if Pushwoosh handles this URL","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            Logger.info(\"URL handled by Pushwoosh\")","            return","        }","","        \/\/ Handle other deep links","        DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","","    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, continue userActivity: NSUserActivity) {","        guard userActivity.activityType == NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb,","              let url = userActivity.webpageURL else { return }","","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            return","        }","","        UniversalLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","}","","\/\/ Legacy AppDelegate support","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ app: UIApplication,","                    open url: URL,","                    options: [UIApplication.OpenURLOptionsKey: Any] = [:]) -> Bool {","","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            return true","        }","","        return DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","}"]}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handleOpenURL:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handleopenurl:"]}],"metadata":{"title":"handleOpenURL:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handleOpenURL:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"handleOpenURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handleOpenURL:","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}]},"schemaVersio